  "2026-09-25T09:09:56.697Z",fleet-wave-script,Created by the 2026-09-25 fleet wave script.
  "2026-09-25T09:39:53.691Z",fleet-wave-script,"Review round 1 (Greptile, pm-changelog#209): the bun gate step said the GitHub Release was not affected, which is false when the Create GitHub release step also failed. It now says only what is known (the publish and tag push had succeeded) and points at the release step's own outcome."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T09:09:56.697Z",fleet-wave-script,The launcher is checked byte-for-byte against node_modules/pm-ops/templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T09:09:56.697Z",fleet-wave-script,A launcher copied unchanged is only unchanged while a test compares it with the template the pinned pm-ops ships
